WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.100
Bro, you should know what people are talking about at FF21.

00:04.400 --> 00:06.600
My experience here has been nothing but the best.

00:06.800 --> 00:09.420
The best part about living here is the community feeling you get.

00:09.640 --> 00:12.580
The moment I came here, I let the introvert out of me.

00:12.600 --> 00:13.940
This is the best place to do that.

00:14.080 --> 00:15.920
Your room is cleaned regularly.

00:16.100 --> 00:18.360
My balcony has a great view. It's very aesthetic.

00:18.420 --> 00:20.620
I stay here, I work here, I play here.

00:20.720 --> 00:23.340
There's carrom, there's pool, there's TT.

00:23.680 --> 00:27.260
We watch movies. Friday nights, Saturday nights, there are events going on.

00:27.340 --> 00:28.640
I think it ticks all the boxes.

00:28.640 --> 00:32.580
This PG has a good amount of safety, like the biometrics

00:32.860 --> 00:35.640
for both the inside door and the outside door.

00:35.740 --> 00:39.580
It's a good opportunity to connect with more people and make more friends.

00:39.800 --> 00:43.800
Amazing views, amazing vibes and the best aesthetics in the whole of Bangalore.

00:43.900 --> 00:45.900
This is one of the best experiences of my life.
